## Design Constraints
- Application enforces:
  - Project existence
  - Project visibility (must be Public)
  - Parent comment existence
  - One-level thread rule
- Domain Comment is immutable

## Required Behavior
### CommentProjectCommand
- Properties:
  - ProjectId (Guid)
  - UserId (Guid)
  - Content (string)
  - ParentCommentId (Guid?)

### Handler Responsibilities
1. Load project by ProjectId
2. Reject if project not found
3. Reject if project is Private
4. If ParentCommentId provided:
   - Load parent comment
   - Reject if not found
   - Reject if parent.ParentCommentId != null
5. Create Comment aggregate
6. Persist comment
7. Return CommentId

## Repository Contracts
### IProjectRepository
- GetById(Guid projectId)

### ICommentRepository
- GetById(Guid commentId)
- Add(Comment comment)

